      ":question/problem": "![](images/3e/3ee3c67774129c7a6b182f04c98794bb39ce46b2cbf2afeebb3863fcc9db2277.png)\n\nConsider the directed graph $G$ above.\nSelect the correct options in the table below that shows paths between the graph's vertices and determine the graph's connectivity.\n\n| **Pair of vertices** | **Path<br>(from $v_{i}$ to $v_{j}$)** | **Reversed path<br>(from $v_{j}$ to $v_{i}$)** |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| $v_{1}$ and $v_{2}$ | $v_{1} \u2192 v_{2}$ | $v_{2} \u2192 v_{3} \u2192 v_{4} \u2192 v_{1}$ |\n| $v_{1}$ and $v_{3}$ | {{field-1}} | $v_{3} \u2192 v_{4} \u2192 v_{1}$ |\n| $v_{1}$ and $v_{4}$ | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |\n| $v_{2}$ and $v_{3}$ | $v_{2} \u2192 v_{3}$ | $v_{3} \u2192 v_{4} \u2192 v_{1} \u2192 v_{2}$ |\n| $v_{2}$ and $v_{4}$ | $v_{2} \u2192 v_{3} \u2192 v_{4}$ | {{field-4}} |\n| $v_{3}$ and $v_{4}$ | $v_{3} \u2192 v_{4}$ | $v_{4} \u2192 v_{1} \u2192 v_{3}$ |\n\nThe above graph $G$ is {{field-5}}."
